; Exports for our proxy dxgi.dll. Only the 3 documented, actually-called
; DXGI factory functions are implemented (see dllmain.cpp for why the other
; 17 undocumented exports don't need forwarding). Plain name-only entries
; work here because the functions are declared extern "C" in dllmain.cpp,
; giving them simple decorated names (link.exe strips the leading
; underscore/stdcall @N suffix automatically when matching a plain .def
; identifier against an extern "C" symbol).

LIBRARY dxgi

EXPORTS
CreateDXGIFactory
CreateDXGIFactory1
CreateDXGIFactory2
